      "content": "<h4 style=\"margin: 14.94pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Types of Rental Houses Available in Hennur</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc0liwupf4282h\",\"id\":\"toc_77ns8abyod1e\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_77ns8abyod1e\"> </span></b></h4><h5 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">1 BHK, 2 BHK, and Studio Apartments</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocqf6hojfn7a8z\",\"id\":\"toc_xjvgfhq1v7ze\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xjvgfhq1v7ze\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocqf6hojfn7a8z\",\"id\":\"toc_xjvgfhq1v7ze\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xjvgfhq1v7ze\"> </span></b></h5><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Hennur offers a variety of housing options including 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and studios. These are perfect for bachelors looking for affordable and small homes.</span></p><h5 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Independent Houses and Shared Accommodations</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocurdwbsm7p9zy\",\"id\":\"toc_orizhr9tj588\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_orizhr9tj588\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocurdwbsm7p9zy\",\"id\":\"toc_orizhr9tj588\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_orizhr9tj588\"> </span></b></h5><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Independent houses are ideal for those looking for more privacy. Shared accommodations are also preferred by bachelors due to cost-effectiveness.</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">.</span></p><h5 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Furnished vs. Semi-Furnished vs. Unfurnished</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tochjxwthmydmif\",\"id\":\"toc_5upluxxz5g9q\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_5upluxxz5g9q\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tochjxwthmydmif\",\"id\":\"toc_5upluxxz5g9q\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_5upluxxz5g9q\"> </span></b></h5><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Furnished Houses:</b> Ideal for those who do not wish to experience hassle-free moving in.<br></span><b>Semi-Furnished Houses: </b>Ideal balance of cost and convenience.<br><b>Unfurnished Houses:</b> Suitable for those who already have furniture.</p><h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000931046\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Factors to Consider When Renting</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc4ss1kkv3lwh8\",\"id\":\"toc_vcm818n6iekj\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_vcm818n6iekj\"> </span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc4ss1kkv3lwh8\",\"id\":\"toc_vcm818n6iekj\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_vcm818n6iekj\"><b> </b><br></span></h2><h5 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Budget and Affordability</b></span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocw1nyl3wz8zup\",\"id\":\"toc_qg7cs7p35j6k\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qg7cs7p35j6k\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocw1nyl3wz8zup\",\"id\":\"toc_qg7cs7p35j6k\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qg7cs7p35j6k\"> </span></h5><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}